+     * non-incrementing between BEGIN and END. Brave Soldiers draws its
+     * full-screen passes this way (post-process and the composite into the
+     * display buffer); dropping it left every display buffer unwritten. The
+     * words are kept big-endian, as they would sit in guest memory, and
+     * drawn at END as an ordinary array draw over this buffer. */
